Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 01:52:45 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1168/1198] HERESY 1167: the night's words in six languages; an
 epoch's two reasons each translated
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

· The catalogs (ru, uk, be, el, es, it), 53 keys:
  – the night towel: New song asks; the 👎 filter; the Trainer's log;
  – the LoRA picker: Sound, together; mute; out of the list; the trigger words by themselves;
  – the Writer: the style as tags, saved briefs, Remember the key, its (i) tips, the guard on the open document;
  – the Creator's and the Refiner's lines;
  – and what a Russian harvest of the live page still showed in English: a stage's time left, the models' load
    times in a run's note, the Trainer's live-row tip.
· heresy-train.js: an epoch worth hearing first for two reasons showed the second in English on a translated page.
  The catalog's pattern for the first reason swallowed the joined line, so each reason is now translated by itself
  before the join.

cdp-console 339/0/7, check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
